OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after police car
OL,4,Ahit with brick
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fspate of incidents, including one in
OL,8,Fwhich a brick was thrown at a police
OL,9,Fcar.
OL,11,FThe attack on the police car happened
OL,12,Fat about 13:00 BST on Saturday on
OL,13,FLinden Avenue, Stourport,
OL,14,FWorcestershire, according to West
OL,15,FMercia Police.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for the force said two
OL,18,Fmen wearing balaclavas and riding a
OL,19,Fblack motorbike approached the vehicle
OL,20,Fbefore one of the men threw a brick at
OL,21,Fthe driver's window.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
