OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after police car
OL,4,Ahit with brick
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officer was not injured but the
OL,7,Fwing mirror was damaged in what Sgt Ian
OL,8,FSquires, from the Wyre Forest Safer
OL,9,FNeighbourhood Team, described as an
OL,10,F"unacceptable and unprovoked attack".
